n 57.6 661.4 m 554.4 661.4 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 15.6 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 641.4 Tm (1\) What a Sequence Builder actually is) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 617.4 Tm (A sequence builder is a timeline editor.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 595.4 Tm (It does not automatically "figure out" a routine for you.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 581.4 Tm (It only runs the exact actions you put on the timeline.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 559.4 Tm (Think of each action like this:) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 537.4 Tm (- At time X, tell target Y to do action Z.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 515.4 Tm (If you do not add an action, that behavior will not happen.) Tj T* ET
.7 w
n 57.6 485.4 m 554.4 485.4 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 15.6 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 465.4 Tm (2\) What an action actually does) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 441.4 Tm (An action is a single command.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 419.4 Tm (Example:) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 397.4 Tm (- "Open Drawer at 0 ms" = one command.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 375.4 Tm (That command does not include "close later." If you want the drawer to close, you ) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 361.4 Tm (must add a second action with a later start time.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 339.4 Tm (Example timeline:) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 317.4 Tm (- Action 1: Start 0 ms -> Drawer -> Open) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 303.4 Tm (- Action 2: Start 3000 ms -> Drawer -> Close) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 281.4 Tm (This means:) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 259.4 Tm (- Open now) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 245.4 Tm (- Wait about 3 seconds) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 231.4 Tm (- Then close) Tj T* ET
.7 w
n 57.6 201.4 m 554.4 201.4 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 15.6 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 181.4 Tm (3\) Beginner mental model \(always use this\)) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 157.4 Tm (Every action answers 4 questions:) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 135.4 Tm (1. When does it start? \(Start ms\)) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 121.4 Tm (2. What does it control? \(Target output/group/LED section\)) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 107.4 Tm (3. What should it do? \(Open/Close/Position/Animation/Off/etc.\)) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 93.4 Tm (4. How long or until what condition? \(Move time, timeout, stop input\)) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
 
